                "message": "✨ feat: match BibTeX names by the surname of an author note\n\nA name with the surname of one author note and compatible given names\n(TW Adorno, Theodor Adorno for Theodor W. Adorno) is a kind of match of its\nown, with its own section and step in fix-authors; names that fit several\nnotes are only reported.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiCsguMS2m92TG5VLGt",
